# Host wiring for automatic Gmail history collection (packet: mail-history 2026-09-22).
# 1. server/index.ts is owned by another session, so this patch is delivered here instead of applied.
# 2. onGmailVerified starts collection when POST /api/agency-setup/check-gmail (or the plan review that completes it) projects the selected account as verified; the service dedupes per (accountId, settingsRevision) and the host never awaits the run.
# 3. observe() reports mailWorkspace.historyStatus() so the setup 'gmail' check says how far collection got, without claiming completeness or changing the check state.
# 4. resumeHistoryIfPending() at boot continues a checkpoint whose approved windows were never confirmed; it re-verifies authority itself and reads nothing when nothing is pending.
# 5. Verified with tsc -p tsconfig.server.json over a copy of the tree with this patch applied: clean. Apply with: git apply outputs/mail-history-2026-09-22/index-patch.diff
--- a/server/index.ts
